      "id": "entry-5007d3",
      "name": "Entry",
      "category": "ToolMenusTestUtilities",
      "signature": "Entry()",
      "params": [],
      "returnType": "TSharedRef<FMenuEntry>",
      "docs": "The factory functions below reduce verbosity when constructing Expected menu structures, and can be used like so:\n@example\nusing namespace UE::ToolMenus;\nconst FMenu ExpectedMenuStructure(\n\"SomeMenu\",\n{\nSection(\"SomeSection\",\n{\nEntry(\"SomeEntry\"),\nAny(),\nEntry(\"AnotherEntry\")\n})\n});"
    },
    {
