        {
          "name": "In Name",
          "type": "Name"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "TSharedRef<FMenuEntry>",
      "docs": "Creates a MenuEntry with a label to match, with wildcards. This will check if the actual entry being tested against matches the given label."
